OL,3,ABBC director general defends plan to
OL,4,Ashelve new Archers studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC's director general has defended
OL,7,Fthe decision not to record The Archers
OL,8,Fat its flagship new Birmingham
OL,9,Fheadquarters - and said options were
OL,10,Fstill being explored to keep it in the
OL,11,FWest Midlands.
OL,13,FPlans to build a bespoke studio for the
OL,14,Flong-running Radio 4 soap at the
OL,15,Fcorporation's new Tea Factory building,
OL,16,Fin Digbeth, were shelved this week as
OL,17,Fpart of a wider drive to cut costs.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
