OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC director general defends plan to
OL,4,Ashelve new Archers studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Brittin, who met with West
OL,7,FMidlands Mayor Richard Parker on
OL,8,FWednesday, said the broadcaster needed
OL,9,Fto save money but they were working
OL,10,Ftogether to look at future recording
OL,11,Flocations.
OL,13,F"We're going to explore how we can best
OL,14,Fhouse The Archers where they need to be
OL,15,Fand at the moment, we have other studio
OL,16,Fspace around the country which could
OL,17,Faccommodate them," he said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
